                                                "sense_id": "8f8f1fcd-851f-3351-9fdf-c42033fa5cc6",
                                                "text": "Now, you know that the classical analytical explanation of agoraphobia of the early 1900s was that it represented a street phobia because the patient equated streetwalking with prostitutional activity[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38d2acac-b3bd-4fa3-9358-c3724dff5313",
                                                "sense_id": "8f8f1fcd-851f-3351-9fdf-c42033fa5cc6",
                                                "text": "There is nothing inherent in the physical union of the sexes to make one prostitutional and the other legitimate or respectable."
